Package: slopeaudit
Type: Package
Title: Diagnose Information Sources in Gaussian Random-Slope Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Tingshan",
      family = "Liu",
      email = "tliu68@jhmi.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Implements diagnostics for person-specific rates of change in
    Gaussian linear mixed models. The package separates direct within-person
    information about a target random slope from information contributed by
    the fitted joint model, tests random-slope heterogeneity with a
    boundary-aware parametric bootstrap, and evaluates prospective information
    under supplied designs. Version 0.1 supports one scalar Gaussian random
    slope through compatible 'lme4' fits and a matrix-based backend.
